{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_05",
  "title": "Train Hopping",
  "storyCode": "RS-5",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a4b2358e9b1c62197c66a1ec602a214f18a418400c40f59296aca872ca12b676",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Grab my hand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Hrh—Hah!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Alright!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "We met on the train back there, but I never imagined you'd save my life here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "How fortunate for you to be here to lend me a hand. Who knows how long I'd be stuck in here otherwise.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "Thank you very, very much for your altruistic assistance, Madam Rosalind Tatyanovna Larina.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Well, wasn't much. Don't mention it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "You definitely <i>don't</i> look like a local, so I'm guessing you're a tourist going up the mountain?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "Precisely.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "So why didn't you follow the main road, instead of falling into a pitfall out here in the forest?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "What were you gonna do if I didn't happen to pass by?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "I was merely attracted by the scenic view, and didn't expect to run into a trap like this in the snow.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "If you hadn't happened by... perhaps I would have stayed here for a while longer. I'd calm down first before figuring out a way to climb out myself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "But now I see how fortunate I am.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Hmm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "Madam Larina, are you going to continue your journey up the mountain?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Huh? Yeah, I am.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "We could travel together for a while, if you wouldn't mind.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "I'd like to admire the view of Kjerag's mountains from the summit as well.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Sure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "I don't mind. Let's go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "We still have a long way to the top.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kjerag Elder",
      "text": "That was...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kjerag Youth",
      "text": "Riley!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kjerag Youth",
      "text": "I just checked our traps and saw a pitfall collapsed. Thought we caught something!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kjerag Youth",
      "text": "But when I took a look, there was nothing inside. Guessing it might have escaped.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kjerag Elder",
      "text": "Did you see the man who passed by earlier? Doesn't he look like the guy Turiels asked us to look out for?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kjerag Youth",
      "text": "You mean the one Degenbrecher asked us to find?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kjerag Elder",
      "text": "All dressed in black, pretentious looking, wearing a hat and hiding his face. No doubt about it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kjerag Elder",
      "text": "Come! Let's hurry back and tell Degenbrecher!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Hey, uh... say, I still don't know your name.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Aren't you guys pretty particular about uh, introducing yourselves when you first meet?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "An oversight on my part.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "You may call me John Smith. Or anything you prefer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "John...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "The name John Smith...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "What do you think of it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Sounds... right out of a spy movie I watched with the Doctor!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Yeah, that was definitely the name of the spy guy!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "I remember he had a really pretty sidekick too, so John, you... Never mind, coming up to this make-out point all alone means you're definitely single.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "A fascinating coincidence.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Alright, let's get back on track. I figure we still have a while to go before the summit.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "I heard it gets colder the higher you go, and it gets harder to breathe too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "So, you tired yet? Need a break?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "Please, don't worry about me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "Do you need to rest, Madam Larina?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Nah, I'm good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "You've got some real stamina, huh, Mr. Spy?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "...Haha.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "Seems like you really deceived him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "I fabricated no lies, Degenbrecher.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "There's no slipping your average falsehoods by a Trilby Asher collecting information for his Duke.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "But I'm fully aware that these types usually know 'suspicion' best.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "'The heir to the Paleroche Clan has secretly returned to the country' is a reality he first discovered by himself, so he'll believe it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "And will definitely be watching Rosalind Tatyanovna Larina.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "Your guesses are always right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "The girl's already on the mountain, and Ratatos has contacted Arctosz.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "I hear tell the Trilby Asher is also on his way up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "He's hiding from me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "No matter.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "Just make sure he remains focused on the girl.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "It's time for you to move as well.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "Fine, I'll treat it as after-meal exercise.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "However, are you sure the Doctor won't mind you letting the Trilby Asher close to the girl?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "He's a spy, not an assassin. What he's after is information, not a life.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "Is that how you plan to explain it to the Doctor?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "To the Doctor, I shall offer my—apologies.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "You certainly owe them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "How I act is unimportant. Rather, I'm more curious—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "Degenbrecher, you remember the Doctor?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "Sharp's a good opponent. Stronger than most of those clumsy knights.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "There's no harm in noting down someone who has the respect of a warrior like that and can also make you suffer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "text": "You're curious about the Doctor?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "You could put it that way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "Alright, the idle chatter stops here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "I'm going to work.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "URA—!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "We're finally here——!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Hoo. We must have climbed a few hours?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "I'm beat. No wonder everyone quits halfway. That was exhausting.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Though...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "The view up here is really pretty... isn't that Lake Silberneherze over there?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Hahaha, the Kjeragandr statue looks smaller than my thumb from up here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "Lake Silberneherze freezes over in the winter, and resembles a pure and clear gemstone when viewed from this peak.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "As such, the locals here believe the lake is a precious stone bestowed by Kjeragandr.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "Truly a view you can only see from such a height.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "It does look like a gem.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Oh, you can even see the station over there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Huh, there's actually plenty of railroads in Kjerag, but the trains all look like toys from here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "I wouldn't call this plenty for a country that's still developing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "It might seem like a lot, but that's because Lake Silberneherze and the Kjeragandr statue are here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "There might be more roads around Karlan currently, but the operating lines will all pass through and transfer here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "...They will, won't they...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Hey, John, you still with us? I need a favor?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Can you help me see if there are two trees growing into each other around here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "They should be old, with intertwining branches, and they look pretty strange too!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "It would be my pleasure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Appreciate it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "You know, John.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Aren't you curious why I'm looking for those trees?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Or what I'm doing up here on the mountain?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "I mulled it over... and decided to handle things the old fashioned way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "What...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "'Fess up, and don't move!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "What is the meaning of this, Madam Larina?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "You're not supposed to say that line yet, I haven't even done anything to you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Spit it out though. You've been following me for ages, just following. What are you after here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "I don't understand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Quit playing dumb!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "I don't remember telling you my name.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "This is a misunderstanding.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "You know the Viscount Harold Craigavon and I have history together, and it was he who told me your name.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Oh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "You think I'm stupid?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "I never told him my full name either.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "And you managed to climb up the summit without taking a single break. There's no way you could have fallen into a simple hunter's trap!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Even if you did, you could have just climbed out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Anna and the girls always tell me to think before I act, but I have to say, sometimes there's no use in thinking too much either.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'John Smith'",
      "text": "You are much more careful than I expected, Madam Larina.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "So you admit it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "John Smith is probably a fake name too, right? Maybe... you really <i>are</i> a spy?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "What if I said yes?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Then you'd be pretty bad at your job.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Cause even I could tell something was up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "Your accusation is absolutely correct.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "It's true. I have been quite careless, and life in Kjerag has made me so.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "I have considerable freedom here, and there aren't many who pose a threat to me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Hah, look at you talk.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "I'm warning you, you'd better behave. And don't move an inch.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "You're standing on the edge of a cliff, and there's nothing but snow under your feet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "I just have to stomp my feet to send you falling, and I can't promise I'll catch you if that happens.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "Alright, Madam Larina. I'll come clean, yesterday...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "text": "Victorian scum!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "text": "Arctosz is here! You stay away from her!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Whoa! Wh-Where did you come from?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Ah-ah-ah-ah, wait! Watch your footfalls, the snow—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "text": "Wahh—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "text": "R-Rosalind!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "text": "Grab my—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "It's somewhat funny, but Arctosz is clearly charging towards me—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "Could Rosalind really have come here for something?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "No matter. He's coming, and I can only jump.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "...The Black Knight.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "All rested up?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "Not yet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "That's not good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "You'll be less fun to fight.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "Going straight into it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "Problem with that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "I'll get straight to my point too then.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "You convinced the Viscount that everything on the train was a misunderstanding. I was only half-convinced at the time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "But now, I know that even the stately Black Knight tells lies.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "That only proves that you don't know me at all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Degenbrecher",
      "text": "There's still time to turn around and go down the mountain for a nice lunch.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "I'm sorry, but I tend to throw myself fully into my work.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
